import Polyfold
/-! Blind formalization of V8_47 (the 2021 book, Part II, §8.4, Proposition 8.4.1, p. 380).

Text: for a strong bundle `P : W → X` over an ep-groupoid the following are equivalent:
(1) `|X|` is paracompact; (2) `|W[0]|` is paracompact; (3) `|W[1]|` is paracompact.

Choices:
- Setting: `Obj Mor : Type` (universe 0) with the instances of the project's `EpGroupoid`,
  `X : EpGroupoid Obj Mor` (Definition 7.3); `W : Type` (same universe, as the project's
  groupoid `(W, 𝐖)` requires) with its topology, `P : W → Obj` with the linear structures on the
  fibres, `B : StrongBundle X.PObj P` and `E : EpStrongBundle X B` (2017 Definition 8.4, the
  structure map `μ`, read with `#print`).  No further hypothesis.
- `|X|`: the project's `X.OrbitSpace` (quotient of `Obj` by "isomorphic") with the quotient
  topology (`#synth`: Mathlib's quotient topology).
- `|W[0]|`: the orbit space of the groupoid `(W, 𝐖)` (objects `W`, morphisms `(φ, w)` from `w`
  to `μ(φ, w)`; the project's `E.toGroupoidStr`, read with `#print`), with the quotient topology
  of `W = W[0]` (the topology of the M-polyfold `W[0]` is the given topology of `W`).  I use the
  groupoid rather than the project's ep-groupoid `E.toEpGroupoid`, which needs an extra
  paracompactness instance on `𝐗 ₛ×_P W`; the orbit space is the same.
- `|W[1]|`: the project's `E.OneOrbitSpace`, read with `#print`: the quotient of
  `W_{0,1} = B.One` (with the topology of `W[1]`, generated by the level-`1` charts) by the
  relation "isomorphic in `(W, 𝐖)`", with the quotient topology.  (Two points of `W_{0,1}` are
  isomorphic in `W[1]` iff they are in `W`, since a morphism `(φ, w)` with `w ∈ W_{0,1}` is a
  morphism of `W[1]`; I accept this identification.)
- "paracompact": Mathlib's `ParacompactSpace` (every open cover has a locally finite open
  refinement; no Hausdorff condition), the reading of 2021 §7.4 used in the Chapter 7 blind files.
- "the following are equivalent": Mathlib's `List.TFAE`.
- Nothing looks false to me.
-/
namespace RoundTrip.V8_47
open Polyfold

/-- Proposition 8.4.1: `|X|`, `|W[0]|`, `|W[1]|` are paracompact together. -/
def B : Prop :=
  ∀ (Obj Mor : Type) [TopologicalSpace Obj] [T2Space Obj] [ParacompactSpace Obj]
    [TopologicalSpace Mor] [T2Space Mor] [ParacompactSpace Mor] (X : EpGroupoid Obj Mor)
    (W : Type) [TopologicalSpace W] [T2Space W] [ParacompactSpace W] (P : W → Obj)
    [∀ x, AddCommGroup (P ⁻¹' {x})] [∀ x, Module ℝ (P ⁻¹' {x})] (B : StrongBundle X.PObj P)
    (E : EpStrongBundle X B),
    List.TFAE
      [ParacompactSpace X.OrbitSpace,
       ParacompactSpace E.toGroupoidStr.OrbitSpace,
       ParacompactSpace E.OneOrbitSpace]

end RoundTrip.V8_47
